#: ../../explanation/roadmap.md:1 d84f7c01ebaa4458a7dadc4535615f14
msgid "Roadmap"
msgstr "ロードマップ"

#: ../../explanation/roadmap.md:3 dab5cf71feb843a591116015607be9e4
msgid ""
"This page provides the public roadmap entry point for GWexpy documentation "
"and feature planning. It is intended as a lightweight overview rather than a"
" release contract."
msgstr ""
"このページは、GWexpy のドキュメント整備と機能計画の**公開ロードマップ入口**です。 "
"厳密なリリース契約ではなく、どの方向へ改善を進めているかを共有するための概要として扱ってください。"

#: ../../explanation/roadmap.md:6 659ff34cbd514a91b11178571d1ca0b5
msgid "How to Read This Page"
msgstr "このページの読み方"

#: ../../explanation/roadmap.md:8 a40a26cc28c9469bb232b68533e45f63
msgid "**Near-term**: areas we expect to improve in upcoming iterations"
msgstr "**直近**: 近いイテレーションで改善優先度が高い領域"

#: ../../explanation/roadmap.md:9 2a1a091132f647bb96889dfed3ba2e6e
msgid ""
"**Mid-term**: work we want to expose more broadly after the current docs and"
" API cleanup"
msgstr "**中期**: 現在の docs / API 整理の後で広げていきたい領域"

#: ../../explanation/roadmap.md:10 fff6d1ade86e476ba97a0ac43cc9b58d
msgid ""
"**Long-term**: exploratory directions that are useful but not yet scheduled"
msgstr "**長期**: 有用だが、まだ具体的な時期を固定していない方向性"

#: ../../explanation/roadmap.md:12 9fb7bdde53cf48eaa9d01157960ff021
msgid ""
"The roadmap is public, but priorities can change based on research needs, "
"maintenance cost, and upstream dependencies."
msgstr "ロードマップは公開していますが、研究上の要請や保守コスト、上流依存の変化によって優先度は変わりえます。"

#: ../../explanation/roadmap.md:14 371e2381b2904f6ca76bfc380bd53bb7
msgid "Near-Term Focus"
msgstr "直近の重点項目"

#: ../../explanation/roadmap.md:16 e3b66a6be3fe4d1e932a946037e9d184
msgid ""
"Documentation quality improvements across navigation, accessibility, and "
"search"
msgstr "ナビゲーション、アクセシビリティ、検索性を含むドキュメント品質改善"

#: ../../explanation/roadmap.md:17 06a65c86437c4c58acd316ceee6e6b89
msgid "Clearer migration guidance for GWpy users"
msgstr "GWpy ユーザー向け移行ガイドの明確化"

#: ../../explanation/roadmap.md:18 54ff618415914eafa40e872b0f4f9e57
msgid "Better notebook and tutorial reliability in CI"
msgstr "notebook / tutorial の CI 上での安定性向上"

#: ../../explanation/roadmap.md:19 b1546a8880c7414284511b8f0dc3ed25
msgid "More explicit references between tutorials, guides, and API pages"
msgstr "チュートリアル、ガイド、API リファレンス間の参照強化"

#: ../../explanation/roadmap.md:21 e0e9d2429a07403fa57251451e8676ab
msgid "Mid-Term Focus"
msgstr "中期の重点項目"

#: ../../explanation/roadmap.md:23 ce1dcbef1fa4469a9c574327c0b6407a
msgid "Broader CLI coverage beyond the current prototype-stage interface"
msgstr "現在は試作段階に留まる CLI の拡張"

#: ../../explanation/roadmap.md:24 ccef5e84279243bea86f5b5bfbe3faf4
msgid ""
"More analysis workflows for noise characterization and time-frequency "
"studies"
msgstr "ノイズ特性評価や時間周波数解析ワークフローの拡充"

#: ../../explanation/roadmap.md:25 11745b9b0f9641eb9c87aaf4ecc65580
msgid ""
"Expanded interoperability guides for external scientific Python libraries"
msgstr "外部科学技術 Python ライブラリとの相互運用ガイド拡張"

#: ../../explanation/roadmap.md:26 261d3303e8a948e8b56bd9ee69b1ef4b
msgid ""
"More public validation notes for numerical and physics-facing algorithms"
msgstr "数値アルゴリズムや物理前提に関する公開検証ノートの充実"

#: ../../explanation/roadmap.md:28 f1b91522308747c2980e8a7dbff4012a
msgid "Long-Term Directions"
msgstr "長期的な方向性"

#: ../../explanation/roadmap.md:30 b216cf8d63be40808a1e1ce340a8b9a2
msgid "Richer visual discovery paths across examples and reference content"
msgstr "事例とリファレンスを横断して探せるビジュアル・ナビゲーションの強化"

#: ../../explanation/roadmap.md:31 292850caca4449c889c2e0b2f806d3c3
msgid ""
"More automation around documentation verification and sample-code validation"
msgstr "ドキュメント検証とサンプルコード検証の自動化拡張"

#: ../../explanation/roadmap.md:32 b5d4494d7d8e44c799c8021133213e74
msgid ""
"Potential improvements to theme, search quality, and interactive visual "
"components"
msgstr "テーマ、検索品質、インタラクティブ表示の改善"

#: ../../explanation/roadmap.md:34 ac78e818f280413e9048fb470bb47f59
msgid "Public Tracking Sources"
msgstr "公開トラッキング先"

